<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="description" content="LUSH Creators: agência que conecta creators a projetos relevantes, com profissionalismo, comunicação clara e condições definidas.">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
<title>LUSH Creators — More than content</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bodoni+Moda:opsz,wght@6..96,500&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#070607;--pink:#F7A8C0;--pink2:#F28DAE;--txt:#F3E4EA;--soft:#E9DDE2;--mut:#CDBFC5;--card:rgba(22,10,17,.78);--line:rgba(247,168,192,.35);--serif:'Bodoni Moda',Georgia,serif;--sans:'Montserrat',system-ui,sans-serif;color-scheme:dark;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 76px);background:var(--bg);-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font-family:var(--sans);overflow-x:hidden}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;height:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);background:rgba(7,6,7,.9);z-index:20}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
img,svg{max-width:100%}
.wrap{width:100%;max-width:1248px;margin:0 auto}
header{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:19;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:68px;padding:0 20px;background:rgba(7,6,7,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(247,168,192,.14)}
.logo img{display:block;height:44px;width:auto;mix-blend-mode:screen}
.links{display:none}
.nv{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;color:#E6D6DC;transition:color .2s}
.nv:hover{color:var(--pink)}
.bt,.bo{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;width:100%;padding:19px 28px;border-radius:999px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.5px;text-align:center;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.bt{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FBD0DD,#F28DAE);color:#1A0B12;box-shadow:0 0 50px rgba(255,90,150,.32)}
.bt:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 0 70px rgba(255,90,150,.5)}
.bo{border:1.5px solid rgba(247,168,192,.7);color:var(--pink)}
.bo:hover{background:rgba(247,168,192,.1)}
header .bt{width:auto;padding:12px 20px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px}
.ey{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;color:var(--pink);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:4px;text-align:center}
.ey i{display:block;flex:0 0 28px;height:2px;background:var(--pink)}
.hd{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;color:#fff;text-align:center;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0;line-height:1.1}
.sec{position:relative;padding:72px 22px}
.lead{margin:20px auto 0;max-width:820px;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(17px,4.6vw,25px);font-weight:300;line-height:1.55;color:var(--soft)}
.hero{padding-top:44px;padding-bottom:64px;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 120% 60% at 50% 30%,rgba(214,70,120,.30),rgba(7,6,7,0) 70%)}
.conn{display:block;width:100%;max-width:720px;height:auto;margin:30px auto 0}
.conn .cv{stroke-width:5}
.conn .lb{font-size:26px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:4px;fill:#E6D6DC;font-family:var(--sans)}
h1.hd{margin-top:30px;font-size:clamp(44px,12.4vw,64px)}
h1 .l{display:block}
h1 .p{color:var(--pink);text-shadow:0 0 50px rgba(255,90,150,.45)}
.acts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin:36px auto 0;max-width:420px}
h2.hd{margin-top:20px;font-size:clamp(34px,9vw,72px)}
.g3{display:grid;gap:18px;margin-top:40px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,290px),1fr))}
.cd{padding:28px;border-radius:26px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.cd b{display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}
.cd p{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.55;color:#EBDFE4}
.steps{display:grid;gap:34px;margin-top:44px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,250px),1fr))}
.st{position:relative;border-top:1px solid rgba(247,168,192,.4);padding-top:26px}
.st u{position:absolute;top:-6px;left:0;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--pink)}
.st em{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-style:normal;font-size:56px;line-height:1;color:var(--pink)}
.st b{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:21px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}
.st p{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.55;color:#EBDFE4}
.big{display:grid;gap:30px;padding:30px 24px;border-radius:30px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(60,20,38,.9),rgba(22,10,17,.9));border:1.5px solid rgba(247,168,192,.6);box-shadow:0 0 90px rgba(255,90,150,.16)}
.num{order:-1;text-align:center}
.num .t{font-size:18px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:7px;color:#fff}
.num .n{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(130px,38vw,210px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-4px;color:var(--pink);text-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(255,90,150,.5)}
.num .d{margin:0 auto;max-width:340px;font-size:17px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.5;color:#EBDFE4}
.tag{color:var(--pink);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:4px;line-height:1.6}
.big h2.hd{text-align:left;margin-top:14px;font-size:clamp(30px,8vw,50px);line-height:1.15}
.big p{margin:16px 0 26px;font-size:17px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.55;color:#EBDFE4}
.final{text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 110% 55% at 50% 55%,rgba(180,50,100,.26),rgba(7,6,7,0) 70%)}
.ig{display:inline-block;margin-top:22px;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:30px;color:#fff}
footer{padding:44px 22px 40px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid rgba(247,168,192,.22)}
footer img{display:block;height:56px;width:auto;margin:0 auto;mix-blend-mode:screen}
footer .fl{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--pink)}
footer .age{margin:16px auto 0;max-width:520px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:2.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--mut)}
footer .cp{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#A99AA1}
@media (min-width:768px){
header{height:84px;padding:0 48px}
.logo img{height:54px}
.sec{padding:104px 48px}
.ey{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:6px;gap:22px}
.ey i{flex-basis:70px}
.hero{padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:96px}
.conn .cv{stroke-width:2.5}
.conn .lb{font-size:14px}
h1 .l{display:inline}
h1.hd{font-size:clamp(56px,7.4vw,116px)}
.acts{flex-direction:row;max-width:none;justify-content:center;margin-top:46px}
.bt,.bo{width:auto;padding:22px 44px;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:3px}
header .bt{padding:14px 26px;font-size:13px}
.cd{padding:32px}
.cd b{font-size:26px}
.cd p{font-size:19px}
.st em{font-size:68px}
.st b{font-size:23px}
.st p{font-size:18px}
.big{padding:56px 64px}
.tag{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:5px}
.big p{font-size:21px}
.num .t{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:10px}
.num .d{font-size:20px}
.ig{font-size:34px}
footer img{height:70px}
}
@media (min-width:1100px){
.links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px}
.big{grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:56px}
.num{order:0}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<a class="logo" href="#topo" aria-label="LUSH Creators"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="LUSH Creators — More than content"></a>
<nav class="links" aria-label="Seções">
<a class="nv" href="#sobre">SOBRE</a>
<a class="nv" href="#como">COMO FUNCIONA</a>
<a class="nv" href="#creators">PARA CREATORS</a>
</nav>
<a class="bt" href="https://www.instagram.com/lushcreators_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">INSTAGRAM</a>
</header>

<main id="topo">

<section class="sec hero">
<div class="ey"><i></i>AGÊNCIA DE CREATORS<i></i></div>
<svg class="conn" viewBox="0 0 720 132" role="img" aria-label="Creator e marca conectados por uma linha">
<defs><linearGradient id="sl" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#F9C2D2"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#F28DAE"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#F9C2D2"/></linearGradient></defs>
<path class="cv" d="M50 56 C 190 -4, 270 108, 360 52 C 450 -4, 540 100, 670 56" fill="none" stroke="url(#sl)" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<circle cx="40" cy="56" r="20" fill="none" stroke="#F7A8C0" stroke-opacity=".45" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="40" cy="56" r="9" fill="#F7A8C0"/>
<circle cx="680" cy="56" r="20" fill="none" stroke="#F7A8C0" stroke-opacity=".45" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="680" cy="56" r="9" fill="#F7A8C0"/>
<path d="M360 26 C362 44 366 48 384 52 C366 56 362 60 360 78 C358 60 354 56 336 52 C354 48 358 44 360 26 Z" fill="#FFD9E5"/>
<text class="lb" x="0" y="126">CREATOR</text>
<text class="lb" x="720" y="126" text-anchor="end">MARCA</text>
</svg>
<h1 class="hd"><span class="l">VOCÊ CRIA.</span> <span class="l p">A GENTE CONECTA.</span></h1>
<p class="lead">Conectamos creators a projetos relevantes, com profissionalismo, comunicação clara e condições definidas.</p>
<div class="acts">
<a class="bt" href="https://www.instagram.com/lushcreators_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FALAR COM A EQUIPE</a>
<a class="bo" href="https://www.instagram.com/lushcreators_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEGUIR NO INSTAGRAM</a>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="sobre">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="ey"><i></i>MORE THAN CONTENT<i></i></div>
<h2 class="hd">Seu conteúdo tem valor.</h2>
<p class="lead">Não é só sobre seguidores. É sobre comunidade, criatividade e conexão. Por isso avaliamos cada perfil com cuidado e respeitamos a realidade de cada creator.</p>
<div class="g3">
<div class="cd"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 26 26" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="11" fill="none" stroke="#F7A8C0" stroke-opacity=".45" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="5" fill="#F7A8C0"/></svg><b>Profissionalismo</b><p>Oportunidades construídas com seriedade para o seu talento.</p></div>
<div class="cd"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 26 26" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="11" fill="none" stroke="#F7A8C0" stroke-opacity=".45" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="5" fill="#F7A8C0"/></svg><b>Comunicação clara</b><p>Condições comerciais definidas antes de qualquer projeto.</p></div>
<div class="cd"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 26 26" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="11" fill="none" stroke="#F7A8C0" stroke-opacity=".45" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="5" fill="#F7A8C0"/></svg><b>Acompanhamento</b><p>Suporte da nossa equipe durante toda a parceria.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="como">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="ey"><i></i>PASSO A PASSO<i></i></div>
<h2 class="hd">Como funciona</h2>
<div class="steps">
<div class="st"><u></u><em>01</em><b>Chame no direct</b><p>Mande uma mensagem para @lushcreators_ no Instagram.</p></div>
<div class="st"><u></u><em>02</em><b>Avaliamos seu perfil</b><p>Olhamos sua identidade, sua audiência e a qualidade dos seus conteúdos.</p></div>
<div class="st"><u></u><em>03</em><b>Definimos as condições</b><p>Alinhamos tudo com clareza antes de começar.</p></div>
<div class="st"><u></u><em>04</em><b>Acompanhamos a parceria</b><p>Nossa equipe fica por perto durante o projeto.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="creators">
<div class="wrap big">
<div>
<div class="tag">PARA CREATORS DE JOGOS DE HABILIDADE</div>
<h2 class="hd">Sua audiência merece parceria de verdade.</h2>
<p>Buscamos creators interessados em divulgar jogos de habilidade, com comunicação clara, condições definidas e suporte da nossa equipe.</p>
<a class="bt" href="https://www.instagram.com/lushcreators_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-flex;width:100%;max-width:420px">QUERO SER CREATOR LUSH</a>
</div>
<div class="num">
<div class="t">COMISSÃO DE ATÉ</div>
<div class="n">35%</div>
<div class="d">sobre o valor dos depósitos gerados pela sua audiência.</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec final">
<svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 2 C22 14 26 18 38 20 C26 22 22 26 20 38 C18 26 14 22 2 20 C14 18 18 14 20 2 Z" fill="#FFD9E5"/></svg>
<h2 class="hd">O próximo passo é com você.</h2>
<p class="lead">Mande uma mensagem para a nossa equipe no Instagram.</p>
<div class="acts"><a class="bt" href="https://www.instagram.com/lushcreators_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FALAR NO INSTAGRAM</a></div>
<a class="ig" href="https://www.instagram.com/lushcreators_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@lushcreators_</a>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
<img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="LUSH Creators">
